{"4460460":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Miniature LAND -Four Seasons-","steam_appid":4460460,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An escape room game made by hand-building and photographing miniature scenes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a miniature world in live-action<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and enjoy feeling like you're really there.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: approximately 1–2 hours.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you entered a miniature world...<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you see a miniature, have you ever imagined<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >what would happen if you could step inside it? This escape room game gives you that experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras\/a32a3543fa55d7d2322ad844db7ec3ca.avif?t=1793286019\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras_big\/a32a3543fa55d7d2322ad844db7ec3ca.avif?t=1793286019 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gimmicks with a tactile feel<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The buildings and gimmicks are all handmade. Experience the realistic textures that only live-action can provide, and the warmth only handmade products can exude.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras\/c5ad612337753a824c1e021d8d98abb1.avif?t=1793286019\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras_big\/c5ad612337753a824c1e021d8d98abb1.avif?t=1793286019 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the seasons<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore areas themed around spring, summer, fall, and winter. Subtle environmental sounds scattered throughout the world will soothe you. Birdsong, crashing waves, leaves rustling, a crackling fireplace, and more...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras\/2c46d1abe9c801053c0716d17f3b6210.avif?t=1793286019\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras_big\/2c46d1abe9c801053c0716d17f3b6210.avif?t=1793286019 width=1560 height=780 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore by clicking on places of interest.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items and solve puzzles to advance.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop items to use them.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An escape room game made by hand-building and photographing miniature scenes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a miniature world in live-action<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and enjoy feeling like you're really there.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: approximately 1–2 hours.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you entered a miniature world...<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you see a miniature, have you ever imagined<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >what would happen if you could step inside it? This escape room game gives you that experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras\/a32a3543fa55d7d2322ad844db7ec3ca.avif?t=1793286019\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras_big\/a32a3543fa55d7d2322ad844db7ec3ca.avif?t=1793286019 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gimmicks with a tactile feel<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The buildings and gimmicks are all handmade. Experience the realistic textures that only live-action can provide, and the warmth only handmade products can exude.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras\/c5ad612337753a824c1e021d8d98abb1.avif?t=1793286019\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras_big\/c5ad612337753a824c1e021d8d98abb1.avif?t=1793286019 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the seasons<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore areas themed around spring, summer, fall, and winter. Subtle environmental sounds scattered throughout the world will soothe you. Birdsong, crashing waves, leaves rustling, a crackling fireplace, and more...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras\/2c46d1abe9c801053c0716d17f3b6210.avif?t=1793286019\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4460460\/extras_big\/2c46d1abe9c801053c0716d17f3b6210.avif?t=1793286019 width=1560 height=780 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore by clicking on places of interest.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items and solve puzzles to advance.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop items to use them.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"An escape room adventure set in a handcrafted miniature world. Can you find your way back home?","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, R